code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Related pages for Web Components</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/CustomElementRegistry\\\"><code>CustomElementRegistry</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/CustomStateSet\\\"><code>CustomStateSet</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/createElement\\\"><code>Document.createElement()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/attachShadow\\\"><code>Element.attachShadow()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/shadowRoot\\\"><code>Element.shadowRoot</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/slot\\\"><code>Element.slot</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/ElementInternals\\\"><code>ElementInternals</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event/composed\\\"><code>Event.composed</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event/composedPath\\\"><code>Event.composedPath</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/attachInternals\\\"><code>HTMLElement.attachInternals()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLSlotElement\\\"><code>HTMLSlotElement</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLTemplateElement\\\"><code>HTMLTemplateElement</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Node/getRootNode\\\"><code>Node.getRootNode()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Node/isConnected\\\"><code>Node.isConnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/ShadowRoot\\\"><code>ShadowRoot</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The <strong><code>customElements</code></strong> read-only property of the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> interface returns a reference to the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/CustomElementRegistry\\\"><code>CustomElementRegistry</code></a> object, which can be used to register new <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_components/Using_custom_elements\\\">custom elements</a> and get information about previously registered custom elements.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The most common example you'll see of this property being used is to get access to the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/CustomElementRegistry/define\\\"><code>CustomElementRegistry.define()</code></a> method to define and register a new custom element, e.g.:</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"4HgNTvIGae4ydXpJTfkVqpm+fHf4yJzEFG14kglYv4A=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">let</span> customElementRegistry <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>customElements<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\ncustomElementRegistry<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">define</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"my-custom-element\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> MyCustomElement<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\\n<p>However, it is usually shortened to something like the following:</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"rknbn+HxqdP8TUXfTCwhC4PAIWNDVqC322X2KrevL04=\\\"><code>customElements<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">define</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"element-details\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">class</span> <span class=\\\"token class-name\\\">extends</span> HTMLElement <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"token function\\\">constructor</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">super</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">const</span> template <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> document<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">getElementById</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"element-details-template\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>content<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">const</span> shadowRoot <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> <span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">this</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">attachShadow</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span> <span class=\\\"token literal-property property\\\">mode</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">:</span> <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"open\\\"</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">appendChild</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>\\n        template<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">cloneNode</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token boolean\\\">true</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\\n<p>See our <a href=\\\"https://github.com/mdn/web-components-examples/\\\" class=\\\"external\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">web-components-examples</a> repo for more usage examples.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#dom-window-customelements\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.customElements\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.customElements\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"}],\"summary\":\"The customElements read-only property of the Window interface returns a reference to the CustomElementRegistry object, which can be used to register new custom elements and get information about previously registered custom elements.\",\"popularity\":0.0054,\"modified\":\"2023-12-08T11:07:32.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"es\",\"title\":\"Window: Propiedad customElements\",\"native\":\"Espa\u00c3\u00b1ol\"},{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window.customElements\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window.customElements\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window.customElements\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.customElements\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/customelements\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/customelements/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/ce10da0e9d23d241b175d8d68bf93507734b7c48\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"customElements\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/customElements\",\"title\":\"customElements\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: customElements property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/devicePixelRatio", "link_title": "devicePixelRatio", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: devicePixelRatio property - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.devicePixelRatio\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/es/docs/Web/API/Window/devicePixelRatio\" hreflang=\"es\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window : propri\u00c3\u