"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard experimental\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Experimental:</strong> <strong>This is an <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/MDN/Writing_guidelines/Experimental_deprecated_obsolete#experimental\\\">experimental technology</a></strong><br>Check the <a href=\\\"#browser_compatibility\\\">Browser compatibility table</a> carefully before using this in production.</p></div><div class=\\\"notecard secure\\\" id=\\\"sect2\\\"><p><strong>Secure context:</strong> This feature is available only in <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/Security/Secure_Contexts\\\">secure contexts</a> (HTTPS), in some or all <a href=\\\"#browser_compatibility\\\">supporting browsers</a>.</p></div>\\n<p>\\n  The <strong><code>documentPictureInPicture</code></strong> read-only property of the\\n  <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> interface returns a reference to the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/DocumentPictureInPicture\\\"><code>DocumentPictureInPicture</code></a> object for the current document context.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"value\",\"title\":\"Value\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>A <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/DocumentPictureInPicture\\\"><code>DocumentPictureInPicture</code></a> object instance.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"l71J9GQSD8Yy7m+6sGF5wMDKmkw4l3cYyF22Hhw8EAc=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">const</span> videoPlayer <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> document<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">getElementById</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"player\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// ...</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Open a Picture-in-Picture window.</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">await</span> window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>documentPictureInPicture<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">requestWindow</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token literal-property property\\\">width</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">:</span> videoPlayer<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>clientWidth<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token literal-property property\\\">height</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">:</span> videoPlayer<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>clientHeight<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// ...</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://wicg.github.io/document-picture-in-picture/#dom-window-documentpictureinpicture\",\"title\":\"Document Picture-in-Picture Specification\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.documentPictureInPicture\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.documentPictureInPicture\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document_Picture-in-Picture_API\\\" title=\\\"Document Picture-in-Picture API\\\">Document Picture-in-Picture API</a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document_Picture-in-Picture_API/Using\\\">Using the Document Picture-in-Picture API</a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Value\",\"id\":\"value\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The documentPictureInPicture read-only property of the\\n  Window interface returns a reference to the DocumentPictureInPicture object for the current document context.\",\"popularity\":0.0009,\"modified\":\"2024-02-05T10:15:39.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/documentpictureinpicture\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/documentpictureinpicture/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/89c435da452257b944b403cc9e45036fcb22590e\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"documentPictureInPicture\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/documentPictureInPicture\",\"title\":\"documentPictureInPicture\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: documentPictureInPicture property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/event", "link_title": "event", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\