-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard deprecated\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Deprecated:</strong> This feature is no longer recommended. Though some browsers might still support it, it may have already been removed from the relevant web standards, may be in the process of being dropped, or may only be kept for compatibility purposes. Avoid using it, and update existing code if possible; see the <a href=\\\"#browser_compatibility\\\">compatibility table</a> at the bottom of this page to guide your decision. Be aware that this feature may cease to work at any time.</p></div>\\n<p>The <code>external</code> property of the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> API returns an instance of the <code>External</code> interface, which was intended to contain functions related to adding external search providers to the browser. However, this is now deprecated, and the contained methods are now dummy functions that do nothing as per spec.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"instance_methods\",\"title\":\"Instance methods\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The <code>External</code> object has the following methods:</p>\\n<figure class=\\\"table-container\\\"><table class=\\\"fullwidth-table\\\">\\n  <tbody>\\n    <tr>\\n      <th>Method</th>\\n      <th>Description</th>\\n    </tr>\\n    <tr>\\n      <td><code>AddSearchProvider(<em>descriptionURL)</em></code></td>\\n      <td>\\n        Dummy function; does nothing. See\\n        <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/OpenSearch#autodiscovery_of_search_plugins\\\">Autodiscovery of search plugins</a>.\\n      </td>\\n    </tr>\\n    <tr>\\n      <td><code>IsSearchProviderInstalled()</code></td>\\n      <td>Dummy function; does nothing.</td>\\n    </tr>\\n  </tbody>\\n</table></figure>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/obsolete.html#external\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.external\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.external\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Instance methods\",\"id\":\"instance_methods\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"}],\"summary\":\"The external property of the Window API returns an instance of the External interface, which was intended to contain functions related to adding external search providers to the browser. However, this is now deprecated, and the contained methods are now dummy functions that do nothing as per spec.\",\"popularity\":0.0018,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009aexternal \u00e5\u00b1\u009e\u00e6\u0080\u00a7\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/external\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/external/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"external\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/external\",\"title\":\"external\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: external property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/fence", "link_title": "fence", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: fence property - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: fence property\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/