/ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Related pages for Fenced Frame API</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fence\\\"><code>Fence</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-experimental\\\" title=\\\"Experimental. Expect behavior to change in the future.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Experimental</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/FencedFrameConfig\\\"><code>FencedFrameConfig</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-experimental\\\" title=\\\"Experimental. Expect behavior to change in the future.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Experimental</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLFencedFrameElement\\\"><code>HTMLFencedFrameElement</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-experimental\\\" title=\\\"Experimental. Expect behavior to change in the future.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Experimental</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/deprecatedReplaceInURN\\\"><code>Navigator.deprecatedReplaceInURN</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-experimental\\\" title=\\\"Experimental. Expect behavior to change in the future.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Experimental</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard experimental\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Experimental:</strong> <strong>This is an <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/MDN/Writing_guidelines/Experimental_deprecated_obsolete#experimental\\\">experimental technology</a></strong><br>Check the <a href=\\\"#browser_compatibility\\\">Browser compatibility table</a> carefully before using this in production.</p></div>\\n<p>The <code>fence</code> read-only property of the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> interface returns a <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fence\\\"><code>Fence</code></a> object instance for the current document context.</p>\\n<p><code>Fence</code> objects are only available to documents embedded inside <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/fencedframe\\\"><code>&lt;fencedframe&gt;</code></a>s (loaded via <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/FencedFrameConfig\\\"><code>FencedFrameConfig</code></a>s) or <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/iframe\\\"><code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code></a>s (loaded via opaque URNs).</p>\\n<div class=\\\"notecard note\\\" id=\\\"sect2\\\">\\n  <p><strong>Note:</strong> See <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fenced_frame_API#how_do_fencedframes_work\\\">How do <code>&lt;fencedframe&gt;</code>s work?</a> for some description around <code>FencedFrameConfig</code>s and opaque URNs.</p>\\n</div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"value\",\"title\":\"Value\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>A <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fence\\\"><code>Fence</code></a> object instance, or <code>null</code> if the document context does not have access to a <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fence\\\"><code>Fence</code></a> object.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"f9gz/TyGU/Zxzot7XnODBMPAAIX9MHlB8avBJ0Yrgmw=\\\"><code>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>fence<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">reportEvent</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token literal-property property\\\">eventType</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">:</span> <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"click\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token literal-property property\\\">eventData</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">:</span> <span class=\\\"token constant\\\">JSON</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">stringify</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span> <span class=\\\"token literal-property property\\\">clickX</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">:</span> <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"123\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token literal-property property\\\">clickY</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">:</span> <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"456\\\"</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token literal-property property\\\">destination</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">:</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">[</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"buyer\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"seller\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">]</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://wicg.github.io/fenced-frame/#dom-window-fence\",\"title\":\"Fenced Frame\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.fence\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.fence\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/privacy-sandbox/fenced-frame/\\\" class=\\\"external\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Fenced frames</a> on developer.chrome.com</li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/privacy-sandbox/\\\" class=\\\"external\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">The Privacy Sandbox</a> on developer.chrome.com</li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Value\",\"id\":\"value\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The fence read-only property of the Window interface returns a Fence object instance for the current document context.\",\"popularity\":0.0009,\"modified\":\"2024-03-05T11:39:43.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/fence\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/fence/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/8a8e2a0ffccde4e391035fe498207d6582ac6a34\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"fence\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/fence\",\"title\":\"fence\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: fence property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/frameElement", "link_title": "frameElement", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type