/code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  The <strong><code>Window.frameElement</code></strong> property\\n  returns the element (such as <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/iframe\\\"><code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code></a> or <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/object\\\"><code>&lt;object&gt;</code></a>)\\n  in which the window is embedded.\\n</p>\\n<div class=\\\"notecard note\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\">\\n  <p>\\n    <strong>Note:</strong> Despite this property's name, it works for documents embedded\\n    within any embedding point, including <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/object\\\"><code>&lt;object&gt;</code></a>,\\n    <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/iframe\\\"><code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code></a>, or <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/embed\\\"><code>&lt;embed&gt;</code></a>.\\n  </p>\\n</div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"value\",\"title\":\"Value\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  The element which the window is embedded into. If the window isn't embedded into\\n  another document, or if the document into which it's embedded has a different\\n  <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Glossary/Origin\\\">origin</a>, the value is <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/null\\\"><code>null</code></a> instead.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"dX9AkgXW/c+V53gER0NqunUFPkrd6z7mSBp56XoSDms=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">const</span> frameEl <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>frameElement<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// If we're embedded, change the containing element's URL to 'https://mozilla.org/'</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">if</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>frameEl<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  frameEl<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>src <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"https://mozilla.org/\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#dom-frameelement-dev\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.frameElement\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.frameElement\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li>\\n    <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/frames\\\"><code>window.frames</code></a> returns an array-like object, listing the direct\\n    sub-frames of the current window.\\n  </li>\\n  <li>\\n    <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/parent\\\"><code>window.parent</code></a> returns the parent window, which is the window\\n    containing the <code>frameElement</code> of the child window.\\n  </li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Value\",\"id\":\"value\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The Window.frameElement property\\n  returns the element (such as <iframe> or <object>)\\n  in which the window is embedded.\",\"popularity\":0.0029,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"es\",\"title\":\"Window.frameElement\",\"native\":\"Espa\u00c3\u00b1ol\"},{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window.frameElement\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"window.frameElement\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window.frameElement\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"ru\",\"title\":\"Window.frameElement\",\"native\":\"\u00d0\u00a0\u00d1\u0083\u00d1\u0081\u00d1\u0081\u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00b8\u00d0\u00b9\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009aframeElement \u00e5\u00b1\u009e\u00e6\u0080\u00a7\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/frameelement\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/frameelement/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"frameElement\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/frameElement\",\"title\":\"frameElement\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: frameElement property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/frames", "link_title": "frames", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" pr