ated\" title=\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\">\n  <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Deprecated</span>\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/speechSynthesis\"><code>speechSynthesis</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/status\"><code>status</code></a><abbr class=\"icon icon-deprecated\" title=\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\">\n  <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Deprecated</span>\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/statusbar\"><code>statusbar</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/toolbar\"><code>toolbar</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/top\"><code>top</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/trustedTypes\"><code>trustedTypes</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/visualViewport\"><code>visualViewport</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/window\"><code>window</code></a></li></ol></details></li><li class=\"toggle\"><details open=\"\"><summary>Instance methods</summary><ol><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/alert\"><code>alert()</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/atob\"><code>atob()</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/back\"><code>back()</code></a><abbr class=\"icon icon-nonstandard\" title=\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\">\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Non-standard</span>\n</abbr><abbr class=\"icon icon-deprecated\" title=\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\">\n  <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Deprecated</span>\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/blur\"><code>blur()</code></a><abbr class=\"icon icon-deprecated\" title=\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\">\n  <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Deprecated</span>\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/btoa\"><code>btoa()</code></a></li><li><a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/cancelAnimationFrame\"><code>cancelAnimationFrame()</code></a