=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard deprecated\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Deprecated:</strong> This feature is no longer recommended. Though some browsers might still support it, it may have already been removed from the relevant web standards, may be in the process of being dropped, or may only be kept for compatibility purposes. Avoid using it, and update existing code if possible; see the <a href=\\\"#browser_compatibility\\\">compatibility table</a> at the bottom of this page to guide your decision. Be aware that this feature may cease to work at any time.</p></div>\\n<p>Returns the orientation in degrees (in 90-degree increments) of the viewport relative to the device's natural orientation.</p>\\n<p>Its only possible values are <code>-90</code>, <code>0</code>, <code>90</code>, and <code>180</code>. Positive values are counterclockwise; negative values are clockwise.</p>\\n<p>This property is deprecated. Use the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Screen/orientation\\\"><code>Screen.orientation</code></a> property instead, available on the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/screen\\\"><code>window.screen</code></a> property.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-window-orientation-angle\",\"title\":\"Compatibility Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.orientation\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.orientation\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"}],\"summary\":\"Returns the orientation in degrees (in 90-degree increments) of the viewport relative to the device's natural orientation.\",\"popularity\":0.0032,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window.orientation\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/orientation\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/orientation/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"orientation\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientation\",\"title\":\"orientation\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: orientation property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/origin", "link_title": "origin", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: origin property - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window : propri\u00c3\u00a9t\u00c3\u00a9 origin\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/Window/origin\" hreflang=\"fr\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"origin\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Window/origin\" hreflang=\"ja\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Document.origin\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/pt-BR/docs/Web/API/Window/origin\" hreflang=\"pt\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Document.origin\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ru/docs/Web/API/Window/origin\" hreflang=\"ru\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009aorigin \u00e5\u00b1\u009e\u00e6\u0080\u00a7\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/Window/origin\" hreflang=\"zh\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: origin property\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/origin\" hreflang=\"en\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" href=\"/static/media/Inter.var.c2fe3cb2b7c746f7966a.woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"MDN Blog RSS Feed\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/blog/rss.xml\" hreflang=\"en\" /><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The origin read-only property of the Window interface returns the origin of the global scope, serialized as a string.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/origin\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Window: origin property - Web APIs | MDN\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The origin read-only property of the Window interface returns the origin of the global scope, serialized as a string.\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/mdn-social-share.cd6c4a5a.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1080\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1920\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"The MDN Web Docs logo, featuring a blue accent color, displayed on a solid black background.\"/><meta proper