span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard experimental\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Experimental:</strong> <strong>This is an <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/MDN/Writing_guidelines/Experimental_deprecated_obsolete#experimental\\\">experimental technology</a></strong><br>Check the <a href=\\\"#browser_compatibility\\\">Browser compatibility table</a> carefully before using this in production.</p></div>\\n<p>The <strong><code>originAgentCluster</code></strong> read-only property of the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> interface returns <code>true</code> if this window belongs to an <em>origin-keyed <a href=\\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-agent-clusters\\\" class=\\\"external\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">agent cluster</a></em>: this means that the operating system has provided dedicated resources (for example an operating system process) to this window's origin that are not shared with windows from other origins.</p>\\n<p>Otherwise this property returns <code>false</code>.</p>\\n<p>Windows that are part of an origin-keyed agent cluster are subjects to some additional restrictions, compared with windows that are not. In particular, they cannot:</p>\\n<ul>\\n  <li>Set <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/domain\\\"><code>Document.domain</code></a>, which is a legacy feature that normally allows same-site cross-origin pages to synchronously access each other's DOM.</li>\\n  <li>Send <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/JavaScript_interface/Module\\\"><code>WebAssembly.Module</code></a> objects to other same-site cross-origin pages via <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/postMessage\\\"><code>Window.postMessage()</code></a>.</li>\\n  <li>Send <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/SharedArrayBuffer\\\"><code>SharedArrayBuffer</code></a> or <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/JavaScript_interface/Memory\\\"><code>WebAssembly.Memory</code></a> objects to other same-site cross-origin pages.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>To request that the browser assign this window to an origin-keyed agent cluster, the server must send the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Origin-Agent-Cluster\\\"><code>Origin-Agent-Cluster</code></a> response header.</p>\\n<p>Note that the origin-keyed agent cluster feature is only supported in <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Glossary/Secure_Context\\\">secure contexts</a>. If a site is not a secure context, the <code>window.originAgentCluster</code> will always return <code>false</code>.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#origin-keyed-agent-clusters\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.originAgentCluster\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.originAgentCluster\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Origin-Agent-Cluster\\\"><code>Origin-Agent-Cluster</code></a> HTTP response header</li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"https://web.dev/articles/origin-agent-cluster\\\" class=\\\"external\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Requesting performance isolation with the Origin-Agent-Cluster header</a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The originAgentCluster read-only property of the Window interface returns true if this window belongs to an origin-keyed agent cluster: this means that the operating system has provided dedicated resources (for example an operating system process) to this window's origin that are not shared with windows from other origins.\",\"popularity\":0.0005,\"modified\":\"2023-12-02T18:58:58.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/originagentcluster\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/originagentcluster/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/ff4efaf7c02da2c945ecedb3752a9b503da8854b\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"originAgentCluster\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/originAgentCluster\",\"title\":\"originAgentCluster\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: originAgentCluster property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight", "link_title": "outerHeight", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: outerHeight property - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerHeight\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/es/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\" hreflang=\"es\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerHeight\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\" hreflang=\"fr\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerHeight\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\" hreflang=\"ja\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerHeight\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\" hreflang=\"ko\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerHeight\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\" hreflang=\"zh\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: outerHeight property\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\" hreflang=\"en\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" href=\"/static/media/Inter.var.c2fe3cb2b7c746f7966a.woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"MDN Blog RSS Feed\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/blog/rss.xml\" hreflang=\"en\" /><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Window.outerHeight read-only property returns the height in pixels of the whole browser window, including any sidebar, window chrome, and window-resizing borders/handles.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Window: outerHeight property - Web APIs | MDN\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The Window.outerHeight read-only property returns the height in pixels of the whole browser window, including any sidebar, window chrome, and window-resizing borders/handles.\"/><meta property