displaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The <strong><code>Window.outerHeight</code></strong> read-only property returns the height in pixels of the whole browser window, including any sidebar, window chrome, and window-resizing borders/handles.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"notes\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>To change the size of a window, see <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeBy\\\"><code>window.resizeBy()</code></a> and <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\\\"><code>window.resizeTo()</code></a>.</p>\\n<p>To get the inner height of a window, i.e. the height of the page being displayed, see <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/innerHeight\\\"><code>window.innerHeight</code></a>.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"graphical_example\",\"title\":\"Graphical example\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>The following figure shows the difference between <code>outerHeight</code> and <code>innerHeight</code>.</p>\\n<p>\\n  <img src=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight/firefoxinnervsouterheight2.png\\\" alt=\\\"innerHeight vs. outerHeight illustration\\\" width=\\\"738\\\" height=\\\"445\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\">\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#dom-window-outerheight\",\"title\":\"CSSOM View Module\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.outerHeight\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.outerHeight\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/innerHeight\\\"><code>window.innerHeight</code></a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/innerWidth\\\"><code>window.innerWidth</code></a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerWidth\\\"><code>window.outerWidth</code></a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeBy\\\"><code>window.resizeBy()</code></a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\\\"><code>window.resizeTo()</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Notes\",\"id\":\"notes\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The Window.outerHeight read-only property returns the height in pixels of the whole browser window, including any sidebar, window chrome, and window-resizing borders/handles.\",\"popularity\":0.0034,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"es\",\"title\":\"Window.outerHeight\",\"native\":\"Espa\u00c3\u00b1ol\"},{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window.outerHeight\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window.outerHeight\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window.outerHeight\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.outerHeight\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/outerheight\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/outerheight/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"outerHeight\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\",\"title\":\"outerHeight\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: outerHeight property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerWidth", "link_title": "outerWidth", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: outerWidth property - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerWidth\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/es/docs/Web/API/Window/outerWidth\" hreflang=\"es\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerWidth\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/Window/outerWidth\" hreflang=\"fr\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerWidth\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Window/outerWidth\" hreflang=\"ja\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.outerWidth\" href=\"https://d