/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/languagechange_event\\\"><code>languagechange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  The read-only <strong><code>scrollX</code></strong> property of the\\n  <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> interface returns the number of pixels that the document is\\n  currently scrolled horizontally. This value is subpixel precise in modern browsers,\\n  meaning that it isn't necessarily a whole number. You can get the number of pixels the\\n  document is scrolled vertically from the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/scrollY\\\" title=\\\"scrollY\\\"><code>scrollY</code></a>\\n  property.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"value\",\"title\":\"Value\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  In practice, the returned value is a double-precision floating-point value with the\\n  range of E(min)=-1022 to E(max)=1023 indicating the number of pixels the document is\\n  currently scrolled horizontally from the origin, where a positive value means the content\\n  is scrolled to the left. If the document is rendered on a subpixel-precise device, then\\n  the returned value is also subpixel-precise and may contain a decimal component. If the\\n  document isn't scrolled at all left or right, then <code>scrollX</code> is 0.\\n</p>\\n<div class=\\\"notecard note\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\">\\n  <p><strong>Note:</strong> If you need an integer value, you can use <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Math/round\\\"><code>Math.round()</code></a> to round it off.</p>\\n</div>\\n<p>\\n  In more technical terms, <code>scrollX</code> returns the X coordinate of the left edge\\n  of the current <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Glossary/Viewport\\\">viewport</a>. If there is no viewport, the returned value is\\n  0.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  This example checks the current horizontal scroll position of the document. If it's\\n  greater than 400 pixels, the window is scrolled back to the beginning.\\n</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"V3SoDmkscAgynDfIAlJsousSLZcwr5Uih+NrlFxpVBg=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">if</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>scrollX <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token number\\\">400</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">scroll</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token number\\\">0</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token number\\\">0</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"notes\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The <code>pageXOffset</code> property is an alias for the <code>scrollX</code> property:</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"VOVj4I4JrXTEOQ/Lw81SPx2l8MEqW8O6s+wtfn4pHOk=\\\"><code>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>pageXOffset <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">===</span> window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>scrollX<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span> <span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// always true</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#dom-window-scrollx\",\"title\":\"CSSOM View Module\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.scrollX\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.scrollX\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/scrollY\\\"><code>Window.scrollY</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Value\",\"id\":\"value\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Notes\",\"id\":\"notes\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The read-only scrollX property of the\\n  Window interface returns the number of pixels that the document is\\n  currently scrolled horizontally. This value is subpixel precise in modern browsers,\\n  meaning that it isn't necessarily a whole number. You can get the number of pixels the\\n  document is scrolled vertically from the scrollY\\n  property.\",\"popularity\":0.0044,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"es\",\"title\":\"Window.scrollX\",\"native\":\"Espa\u00c3\u00b1ol\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"window.scrollX\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window.scrollX\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"ru\",\"title\":\"Window.scrollX\",\"native\":\"\u00d0\u00a0\u00d1\u0083\u00d1\u0081\u00d1\u0081\u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00b8\u00d0\u00b9\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.scrollX\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/scrollx\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/scrollx/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"scrollX\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/scrollX\",\"title\":\"scrollX\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: scrollX property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/scrollY", "link_title": "scrollY", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: scrollY property - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.scrollY\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/es/docs/Web/API/Window/scrollY\" hreflang=\"es\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.scrollY\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/Window/scrollY\" hreflang=\"fr\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"window.scrollY\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.or