n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Experimental</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/sizeToContent\\\"><code>sizeToContent()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/stop\\\"><code>stop()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/updateCommands\\\"><code>updateCommands()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage\\\"><code>webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/webkitConvertPointFromPageToNode\\\"><code>webkitConvertPointFromPageToNode()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Events</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/afterprint_event\\\"><code>afterprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/appinstalled_event\\\"><code>appinstalled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeinstallprompt_event\\\"><code>beforeinstallprompt</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeprint_event\\\"><code>beforeprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeunload_event\\\"><code>beforeunload</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/blur_event\\\"><code>blur</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/copy_event\\\"><code>copy</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/cut_event\\\"><code>cut</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\\\"><code>devicemotion</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientation_event\\\"><code>deviceorientation</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientationabsolute_event\\\"><code>deviceorientationabsolute</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/error_event\\\"><code>error</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/focus_event\\\"><code>focus</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepadconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepadconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepaddisconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepaddisconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/hashchange_event\\\"><code>hashchange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/languagechange_event\\\"><code>languagechange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Related pages for Web Storage API</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Storage\\\"><code>Storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/StorageEvent\\\"><code>StorageEvent</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/localStorage\\\"><code>Window.localStorage</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  The read-only <strong><code>sessionStorage</code></strong>\\n  property accesses a session <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Storage\\\"><code>Storage</code></a> object for the current\\n  <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Glossary/Origin\\\">origin</a>. <code>sessionStorage</code> is similar to\\n  <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/localStorage\\\" title=\\\"localStorage\\\"><code>localStorage</code></a>; the difference is that while data\\n  in <code>localStorage</code> doesn't expire, data in <code>sessionStorage</code> is\\n  cleared when the <em>page session</em> ends.\\n</p>\\n<ul>\\n  <li>\\n    Whenever a document is loaded in a particular tab in the browser, a unique page\\n    session gets created and assigned to that particular tab. That page session is valid\\n    only for that particular tab.\\n  </li>\\n  <li>\\n    A page session lasts as long as the tab or the browser is open, and survives over\\n    page reloads and restores.\\n  </li>\\n  <li><strong>Opening a page in a new tab or window creates a new session with the value\\nof the top-level browsing context, which differs from how session cookies\\nwork.</strong></li>\\n  <li>\\n    Opening multiple tabs/windows with the same URL creates <code>sessionStorage</code>\\n    for each tab/window.\\n  </li>\\n  <li>\\n    Duplicating a tab copies the tab's <code>sessionStorage</code> into the new\\n    tab.\\n  </li>\\n  <li>\\n    Closing a tab/window ends the session and clears objects in\\n    <code>sessionStorage</code>.\\n  </li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>\\n  Data stored in <code>sessionStorage</code> <strong>is specific to the protocol of the\\npage</strong>. In particular, data stored by a script on a site accessed with HTTP\\n  (e.g., <a href=\\\"https://example.com\\\" class=\\\"external\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">http://example.com</a>) is\\n  put in a different <code>sessionStorage</code> object from the same site accessed with\\n  HTTPS (e.g., <a href=\\\"https://example.com\\\" class=\\\"external\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://example.com</a>).\\n</p>\\n<p>\\n  The keys and the values are <em>always</em> in the UTF-16 string\\n  format, which uses two bytes per character. As with objects, integer keys are\\n  automatically converted to strings.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"value\",\"title\":\"Value\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  A <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Storage\\\"><code>Storage</code></a> object which can be used to access the current origin's\\n  session storage space.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"exceptions\",\"title\":\"Exceptions\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<dl>\\n  <dt id=\\\"securityerror\\\"><a href=\\\"#securityerror\\\"><code>SecurityError</code></a></dt>\\n  <dd>\\n    <p>Thrown in one of the following cases:</p>\\n    <ul>\\n      <li>The origin is not <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/Security/Same-origin_policy#definition_of_an_origin\\\">a valid scheme/host/port tuple</a>. This can happen if the origin uses the <code>file:</code> or <code>data:</code> schemes, for example.</li>\\n      <li>The request violates a policy decision. For example, the user has configured the browsers to prevent the page from persisting data.</li>\\n    </ul>\\n    <p>Note that if the user blocks cookies, browsers will probably interpret this as an instruction to prevent the page from persisting data.</p>\\n  </dd>\\n</dl>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"basic_usage\",\"title\":\"Basic usage\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"9rt3PjQ3dkjvjILf6Ix/AlCC9qdcvQyU3x378odtrQE=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Save data to sessionStorage</span>\\nsessionStorage<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">setItem</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"key\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"value\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Get saved data from sessionStorage</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">let</span> data <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> sessionStorage<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">getItem</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"key\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Remove saved data from sessionStorage</span>\\nsessionStorage<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">removeItem</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"key\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Remove all saved data from sessionStorage</span>\\nsessionStorage<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">clear</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"saving_text_between_refreshes\",\"title\":\"Saving text between refreshes\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  The following example autosaves the contents of a text field, and if the browser is\\n  refreshed, restores the text field content so that no writing is lost.\\n</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"y8RyqNbrskWpqQs4yuHYqOnx0Pu/LUfHppXP80cqyrg=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Get the text field that we're going to track</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">let</span> field <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> document<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">getElementById</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"field\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// See if we have an autosave value</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// (this will only happen if the page is accidentally refreshed)</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">if</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>sessionStorage<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">getItem</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"autosave\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Restore the contents of the text field</span>\\n  field<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>value <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> sessionStorage<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">getItem</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"autosave\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Listen for changes in the text field</span>\\nfield<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">addEventListener</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"change\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// And save the results into the session storage object</span>\\n  sessionStorage<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">setItem</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"autosave\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> field<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>value<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\\n<div class=\\\"notecard note\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\">\\n  <p><strong>Note:</strong> Please refer to the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Storage_API/Using_the_Web_Storage_API\\\">Using the Web Storage API</a> article for a full example.</p>\\n</div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webstorage.html#dom-sessionstorage-dev\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.sessionStorage\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.sessionStorage\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Storage_API/Using_the_Web_Storage_API\\\">Using the Web Storage API</a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/localStorage\\\"><code>Window.localStorage</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Value\",\"id\":\"value\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The read-only sessionStorage\\n  property accesses a session Storage object for the current\\n  origin. sessionStorage is similar to\\n  localStorage; the difference is that while data\\n  in localStorage doesn't expire, data in sessionStorage is\\n  cleared when the page session ends.\",\"popularity\":0.1013,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"es\",\"title\":\"Window.sessionStorage\",\"native\":\"Espa\u00c3\u00b1ol\"},{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window.sessionStorage\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window: sessionStorage \u00e3\u0083\u0097\u00e3\u0083\u00ad\u00e3\u0083\u0091\u00e3\u0083\u0086\u00e3\u0082\u00a3\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window.sessionStorage\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"pt-BR\",\"title\":\"Window.sessionStorage\",\"native\":\"Portugu\u00c3\u00aas (do\u00c2\u00a0Brasil)\"},{\"locale\":\"ru\",\"title\":\"Window.sessionStorage\",\"native\":\"\u00d0\u00a0\u00d1\u0083\u00d1\u0081\u00d1\u0081\u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00b8\u00d0\u00b9\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.sessionStorage\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-TW\",\"title\":\"Window.sessionStorage\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u00ad\u00a3\u00e9\u00ab\u0094\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00b9\u0081\u00e9\u00ab\u0094)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/sessionstorage\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/sessionstorage/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"sessionStorage\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/sessionStorage\",\"title\":\"sessionStorage\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: sessionStorage property - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance properties", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/sharedStorage", "link_title": "sharedStorage", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: sharedStorage property - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: sharedStorage property\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/sharedStorage\" hreflang=\"en\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" href=\"/static/media/Inter.var.c2fe3cb2b7c746f7966a.woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"MDN Blog RSS Feed\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/blog/rss.xml