eorientationabsolute</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/error_event\\\"><code>error</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/focus_event\\\"><code>focus</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepadconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepadconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepaddisconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepaddisconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/hashchange_event\\\"><code>hashchange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/languagechange_event\\\"><code>languagechange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard nonstandard\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Non-standard:</strong> This feature is non-standard and is not on a standards track. Do not use it on production sites facing the Web: it will not work for every user. There may also be large incompatibilities between implementations and the behavior may change in the future.</p></div><div class=\\\"notecard deprecated\\\" id=\\\"sect2\\\"><p><strong>Deprecated:</strong> This feature is no longer recommended. Though some browsers might still support it, it may have already been removed from the relevant web standards, may be in the process of being dropped, or may only be kept for compatibility purposes. Avoid using it, and update existing code if possible; see the <a href=\\\"#browser_compatibility\\\">compatibility table</a> at the bottom of this page to guide your decision. Be aware that this feature may cease to work at any time.</p></div>\\n<p>\\n  The obsolete and non-standard method <code>back()</code> on the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>window</code></a>\\n  interface returns the window to the previous item in the history. This was a\\n  Firefox-specific method and was removed in Firefox 31.\\n</p>\\n<div class=\\\"notecard note\\\" id=\\\"sect3\\\">\\n  <p><strong>Note:</strong> Use the standard <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/History/back\\\"><code>history.back</code></a> method instead.</p>\\n</div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"hSPZ1JiGJSBCBRrBnnY47Jq8v6TMwUxl1uUGo/k6zxM=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">back</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"parameters\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>None.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"return_value\",\"title\":\"Return value\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>None (<a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/undefined\\\"><code>undefined</code></a>).</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>This simple example handles a click on a \\\"Back\\\" button by calling <code>back()</code>.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"gtDmGiqzNoihwHw/R/RVXEqK7mtlZJNsBD3IkE0+Z5o=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">function</span> <span class=\\\"token function\\\">handleMyBackButton</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">if</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>canGoBack<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n    window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">back</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"specifications\",\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>This is not part of any specification.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  This non-standard method was only implemented in Firefox, and was removed in Firefox\\n  31.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/History/back\\\"><code>History.back()</code></a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/History/forward\\\"><code>History.forward()</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The obsolete and non-standard method back() on the window\\n  interface returns the window to the previous item in the history. This was a\\n  Firefox-specific method and was removed in Firefox 31.\",\"popularity\":0.0033,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window.back()\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window.back()\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.back()\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/back\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/back/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"back()\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/back\",\"title\":\"back()\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: back() method - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance methods", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/blur", "link_title": "blur()", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: blur() method - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.blur()\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/Window/blur\" hreflang=\"fr\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.blur()\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Window/blur\" hreflang=\"ja\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.blur()\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ru/docs/Web/API/Window/blur\" hreflang=\"ru\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.blur