><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/moveBy\\\"><code>moveBy()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/moveTo\\\"><code>moveTo()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/open\\\"><code>open()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/postMessage\\\"><code>postMessage()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/print\\\"><code>print()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/prompt\\\"><code>prompt()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/queryLocalFonts\\\"><code>queryLocalFonts()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-experimental\\\" title=\\\"Experimental. Expect behavior to change in the future.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Experimental</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/releaseEvents\\\"><code>releaseEvents()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/requestAnimationFrame\\\"><code>requestAnimationFrame()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/requestFileSystem\\\"><code>requestFileSystem()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/requestIdleCallback\\\"><code>requestIdleCallback()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeBy\\\"><code>resizeBy()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\\\"><code>resizeTo()</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/scroll\\\"><code>scroll()</code></a></li><li><