>Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p><code>window.confirm()</code> instructs the browser to display a dialog with an optional message, and to wait until the user either confirms or cancels the dialog.</p>\\n<p>Under some conditions \u00e2\u0080\u0094 for example, when the user switches tabs \u00e2\u0080\u0094 the browser may not actually display a dialog, or may not wait for the user to confirm or cancel the dialog.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"GPvig2hFPYV0VrlQn+F55m4m1Kv5Ecw+vNtziNPTEOs=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">confirm</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>message<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"parameters\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<dl>\\n  <dt id=\\\"message\\\"><a href=\\\"#message\\\"><code>message</code></a></dt>\\n  <dd>\\n    <p>A string you want to display in the confirmation dialog.</p>\\n  </dd>\\n</dl>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"return_value\",\"title\":\"Return value\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  A boolean indicating whether OK (<code>true</code>) or Cancel (<code>false</code>) was\\n  selected. If a browser is ignoring in-page dialogs, then the returned value is always\\n  <code>false</code>.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"67UfmPgCtzgpVue4OyBgxl8MUPxb6QnekVLvHmLhHTM=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">if</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">confirm</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"Do you really want to leave?\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">open</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"exit.html\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"Thanks for Visiting!\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\\n<p>Produces:</p>\\n<p>\\n  <img src=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/confirm/firefox_confirm_dialog.png\\\" alt=\\\"Firefox confirm\\\" width=\\\"354\\\" height=\\\"119\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\">\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"notes\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  Dialog boxes are modal windows \u00e2\u0080\u0094 they\\n  prevent the user from accessing the rest of the program's interface until the dialog box\\n  is closed. For this reason, you should not overuse any function that creates a dialog\\n  box (or modal window). Regardless, there are good reasons to <a href=\\\"https://alistapart.com/article/neveruseawarning/\\\" class=\\\"external\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">avoid using dialog boxes for confirmation</a>.\\n</p>\\n<p>Alternatively <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/dialog\\\"><code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code></a> element can be used for confirmations.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/timers-and-user-prompts.html#dom-confirm-dev\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.confirm\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.confirm\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/dialog\\\"><code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code></a> element</li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/alert\\\"><code>window.alert()</code></a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/prompt\\\"><code>window.prompt()</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Notes\",\"id\":\"notes\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"window.confirm() instructs the browser to display a dialog with an optional message, and to wait until the user either confirms or cancels the dialog.\",\"popularity\":0.0356,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"es\",\"title\":\"Window: M\u00c3\u00a9todo confirm() \",\"native\":\"Espa\u00c3\u00b1ol\"},{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window : m\u00c3\u00a9thode confirm()\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"window.confirm\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window.confirm()\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"pt-BR\",\"title\":\"Window.confirm()\",\"native\":\"Portugu\u00c3\u00aas (do\u00c2\u00a0Brasil)\"},{\"locale\":\"ru\",\"title\":\"Window.confirm()\",\"native\":\"\u00d0\u00a0\u00d1\u0083\u00d1\u0081\u00d1\u0081\u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00b8\u00d0\u00b9\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009aconfirm() \u00e6\u0096\u00b9\u00e6\u00b3\u0095\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/confirm\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/confirm/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"confirm()\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/confirm\",\"title\":\"confirm()\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: confirm() method - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance methods", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/dump", "link_title": "dump()", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: dump() method - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.dump()\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/Window/dump\" hreflang=\"fr\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"window.dump()\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Window/dump\" hreflang=\"ja\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009adump() \u00e6\u0096\u00b9\u00e6\u00b3\u0095\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/Window/dump\" hreflang=\"zh\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: dump() method\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/dump\" hreflang=\"en\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" href=\"/static/media/Inter.var.c2fe3cb2b7c746f7966a.woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"MDN Blog RSS Feed\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/blog/rss.xml\" hreflang=\"en\" /><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Window.dump() method logs messages to the browser&apos;s standard output (stdout). If the browser was started from a ter