"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/appinstalled_event\\\"><code>appinstalled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeinstallprompt_event\\\"><code>beforeinstallprompt</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeprint_event\\\"><code>beforeprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeunload_event\\\"><code>beforeunload</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/blur_event\\\"><code>blur</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/copy_event\\\"><code>copy</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/cut_event\\\"><code>cut</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\\\"><code>devicemotion</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientation_event\\\"><code>deviceorientation</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientationabsolute_event\\\"><code>deviceorientationabsolute</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/error_event\\\"><code>error</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/focus_event\\\"><code>focus</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepadconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepadconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepaddisconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepaddisconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/hashchange_event\\\"><code>hashchange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/languagechange_event\\\"><code>languagechange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard deprecated\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Deprecated:</strong> This feature is no longer recommended. Though some browsers might still support it, it may have already been removed from the relevant web standards, may be in the process of being dropped, or may only be kept for compatibility purposes. Avoid using it, and update existing code if possible; see the <a href=\\\"#browser_compatibility\\\">compatibility table</a> at the bottom of this page to guide your decision. Be aware that this feature may cease to work at any time.</p></div>\\n<p>Releases the window from trapping events of a specific type.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"yXAqMaqkz88wyq9Up+tICGrcoyZtinUjCn6N/Mu9wrE=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">releaseEvents</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>eventType<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"parameters\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<dl>\\n  <dt id=\\\"eventtype\\\"><a href=\\\"#eventtype\\\"><code>eventType</code></a></dt>\\n  <dd>\\n    <p>\\n      <code>eventType</code> is a combination of the following values:\\n      <code>Event.ABORT</code>, <code>Event.BLUR</code>, <code>Event.CLICK</code>,\\n      <code>Event.CHANGE</code>, <code>Event.DBLCLICK</code>, <code>Event.DRAGDDROP</code>,\\n      <code>Event.ERROR</code>, <code>Event.FOCUS</code>, <code>Event.KEYDOWN</code>,\\n      <code>Event.KEYPRESS</code>, <code>Event.KEYUP</code>, <code>Event.LOAD</code>,\\n      <code>Event.MOUSEDOWN</code>, <code>Event.MOUSEMOVE</code>, <code>Event.MOUSEOUT</code>,\\n      <code>Event.MOUSEOVER</code>, <code>Event.MOUSEUP</code>, <code>Event.MOVE</code>,\\n      <code>Event.RESET</code>, <code>Event.RESIZE</code>, <code>Event.SELECT</code>,\\n      <code>Event.SUBMIT</code>, <code>Event.UNLOAD</code>.\\n    </p>\\n  </dd>\\n</dl>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"return_value\",\"title\":\"Return value\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>None (<a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/undefined\\\"><code>undefined</code></a>).</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"34BC3yuu/Pzj6mRF4BRFAQkYNr96w414nC2foeWpj/M=\\\"><code>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">releaseEvents</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>Event<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token constant\\\">KEYPRESS</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"notes\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  Note that you can pass a list of events to this method using the following syntax:\\n  <code>window.releaseEvents(Event.KEYPRESS | Event.KEYDOWN | Event.KEYUP)</code>.\\n</p>\\n<p>\\n  See also <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/captureEvents\\\"><code>window.captureEvents</code></a>\\n  (<abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr>).\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"specifications\",\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>This is not part of any specification.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.releaseEvents\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Notes\",\"id\":\"notes\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"}],\"summary\":\"Releases the window from trapping events of a specific type.\",\"popularity\":0.0011,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window.releaseEvents()\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/releaseevents\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/releaseevents/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"releaseEvents()\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/releaseEvents\",\"title\":\"releaseEvents()\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: releaseEvents() method - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance methods", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/requestAnimationFrame", "link_title": "requestAnimationFrame()", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: requestAnimationFram