/li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  The <strong><code>Window.resizeBy()</code></strong> method resizes the current window\\n  by a specified amount.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"/t/EaunsRpzgXQnShkxjPtpcCeo6MJKYC0S516irVCE=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">resizeBy</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>xDelta<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> yDelta<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"parameters\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><code>xDelta</code> is the number of pixels to grow the window horizontally.</li>\\n  <li><code>yDelta</code> is the number of pixels to grow the window vertically.</li>\\n</ul>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"return_value\",\"title\":\"Return value\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>None (<a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/undefined\\\"><code>undefined</code></a>).</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"xgAgMOCBrA1V8E4iZ6yqBYuu0zN+k+VMnBEOaFY5r0U=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Shrink the window</span>\\nwindow<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">resizeBy</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">-</span><span class=\\\"token number\\\">200</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">-</span><span class=\\\"token number\\\">200</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"notes\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  This method resizes the window relative to its current size. To resize the window in\\n  absolute terms, use <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\\\"><code>window.resizeTo()</code></a>.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"creating_and_resizing_an_external_window\",\"title\":\"Creating and resizing an external window\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  For security reasons, it's no longer possible in Firefox for a website to change the\\n  default size of a window in a browser if the window wasn't created by\\n  <code>window.open()</code>, or contains more than one tab. See the compatibility table\\n  for details on the change.\\n</p>\\n<p>\\n  Even if you create window by <code>window.open()</code> <strong>it is not resizable by\\ndefault.</strong> To make the window resizable, you must open it with the\\n  <code>\\\"resizable\\\"</code> feature.\\n</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"IlQSPC1EfQFv/tK8LwBVWnhdbOpBkpP11+nW6uQMah4=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Create resizable window</span>\\nmyExternalWindow <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">open</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"https://example.com\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"myWindowName\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"resizable\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Resize window to 500x500</span>\\nmyExternalWindow<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">resizeTo</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token number\\\">500</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token number\\\">500</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// Make window relatively smaller to 400x400</span>\\nmyExternalWindow<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">resizeBy</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token operator\\\">-</span><span class=\\\"token number\\\">100</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">-</span><span class=\\\"token number\\\">100</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\\n<p>\\n  The window you create must respect the Same Origin Policy. If the window you open is\\n  not in the same origin as the current window, you will not be able to resize, or access\\n  any information on, that window/tab.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#dom-window-resizeby\",\"title\":\"CSSOM View Module\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.resizeBy\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.resizeBy\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Notes\",\"id\":\"notes\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"}],\"summary\":\"The Window.resizeBy() method resizes the current window\\n  by a specified amount.\",\"popularity\":0.0026,\"modified\":\"2023-07-07T07:19:19.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window.resizeBy()\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window.resizeBy()\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.resizeBy()\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/resizeby\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/resizeby/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/acfe8c9f1f4145f77653a2bc64a9744b001358dc\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"resizeBy()\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeBy\",\"title\":\"resizeBy()\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: resizeBy() method - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance methods", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo", "link_title": "resizeTo()", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: resizeTo() method - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.resizeTo()\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\" hreflang=\"ja\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.resizeTo()\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\" hreflang=\"ko\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.resizeTo\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\" hreflang=\"zh\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: resizeTo() method\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\" hreflang=\"en\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=