rameters\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<dl>\\n  <dt id=\\\"width\\\"><a href=\\\"#width\\\"><code>width</code></a></dt>\\n  <dd>\\n    <p>\\n      An integer representing the new <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerWidth\\\" title=\\\"outerWidth\\\"><code>outerWidth</code></a> in\\n      pixels (including scroll bars, title bars, etc.).\\n    </p>\\n  </dd>\\n  <dt id=\\\"height\\\"><a href=\\\"#height\\\"><code>height</code></a></dt>\\n  <dd>\\n    <p>\\n      An integer value representing the new\\n      <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/outerHeight\\\" title=\\\"outerHeight\\\"><code>outerHeight</code></a> in pixels (including scroll bars,\\n      title bars, etc.).\\n    </p>\\n  </dd>\\n</dl>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"return_value\",\"title\":\"Return value\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>None (<a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/undefined\\\"><code>undefined</code></a>).</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  This function resizes the window so that it takes up one quarter of the available\\n  screen. See the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Screen/availWidth\\\"><code>Screen.availWidth</code></a> and <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Screen/availHeight\\\"><code>Screen.availHeight</code></a>\\n  properties.\\n</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"+iy/7U9WaOfPx9z3dSZFvIud7gzNNhYyYEfbKD+ntWI=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token keyword\\\">function</span> <span class=\\\"token function\\\">quarter</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">resizeTo</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>screen<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>availWidth <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">/</span> <span class=\\\"token number\\\">2</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>screen<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span>availHeight <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">/</span> <span class=\\\"token number\\\">2</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#dom-window-resizeto\",\"title\":\"CSSOM View Module\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.resizeTo\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.resizeTo\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>\\n  Note: It's not possible to resize a window or tab that wasn't created by\\n  <strong><code>window.open()</code></strong>. It's also not possible to resize when the\\n  window has multiple tabs.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeBy\\\"><code>window.resizeBy()</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The Window.resizeTo() method dynamically resizes the\\n  window.\",\"popularity\":0.0072,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window.resizeTo()\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window.resizeTo()\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.resizeTo\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/resizeto\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/resizeto/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"resizeTo()\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resizeTo\",\"title\":\"resizeTo()\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: resizeTo() method - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance methods", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/scroll", "link_title": "scroll()", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: scroll() method - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window.scroll()\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/es/docs/Web/API/Window/scroll\" hreflang=\"es\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\