a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard nonstandard\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Non-standard:</strong> This feature is non-standard and is not on a standards track. Do not use it on production sites facing the Web: it will not work for every user. There may also be large incompatibilities between implementations and the behavior may change in the future.</p></div>\\n<p>\\n  The <strong><code>Window.sizeToContent()</code></strong> method sizes the window\\n  according to its content. In order for it to work, the DOM content should be loaded when\\n  this function is called\u00e2\u0080\u0094for example, once the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/DOMContentLoaded_event\\\" title=\\\"DOMContentLoaded\\\"><code>DOMContentLoaded</code></a> event has\\n  been thrown.\\n</p>\\n<p>\\n  Since Firefox 20, the minimal size of the window is clamped to prevent the window from\\n  being too small for the user to interact with.\\n</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"PReeeiuCrcxOU8uo5R54G6RK4uxFltSFyYMma102pAI=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">sizeToContent</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"parameters\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>None.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"return_value\",\"title\":\"Return value\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>None (<a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/undefined\\\"><code>undefined</code></a>).</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"FktC1r26iiuRRE6YVrgI43SZ/QX/PyubOvxuPf+S6SI=\\\"><code>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">sizeToContent</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"specifications\",\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>This feature is not part of any specification.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.sizeToContent\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The Window.sizeToContent() method sizes the window\\n  according to its content. In order for it to work, the DOM content should be loaded when\\n  this function is called\u00e2\u0080\u0094for example, once the DOMContentLoaded event has\\n  been thrown.\",\"popularity\":0.0008,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window.sizeToContent()\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.sizeToContent()\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/sizetocontent\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/sizetocontent/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"sizeToContent()\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/sizeToContent\",\"title\":\"sizeToContent()\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: sizeToContent() method - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance methods", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/stop", "link_title": "stop()", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/op