=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/webkitConvertPointFromPageToNode\\\"><code>webkitConvertPointFromPageToNode()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Events</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/afterprint_event\\\"><code>afterprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/appinstalled_event\\\"><code>appinstalled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeinstallprompt_event\\\"><code>beforeinstallprompt</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeprint_event\\\"><code>beforeprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeunload_event\\\"><code>beforeunload</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/blur_event\\\"><code>blur</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/copy_event\\\"><code>copy</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/cut_event\\\"><code>cut</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\\\"><code>devicemotion</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientation_event\\\"><code>deviceorientation</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientationabsolute_event\\\"><code>deviceorientationabsolute</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/error_event\\\"><code>error</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/focus_event\\\"><code>focus</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepadconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepadconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepaddisconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepaddisconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/hashchange_event\\\"><code>hashchange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/languagechange_event\\\"><code>languagechange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"notecard nonstandard\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\"><p><strong>Non-standard:</strong> This feature is non-standard and is not on a standards track. Do not use it on production sites facing the Web: it will not work for every user. There may also be large incompatibilities between implementations and the behavior may change in the future.</p></div>\\n<p>Updates the state of commands of the current chrome window (UI).</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"+0xfcomxZ4SN+UPOcuqODqPTBxbfl7B66fjr/cgoCjc=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">updateCommands</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"sCommandName\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"parameters\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><code>sCommandName</code> is a particular string which describes what kind of update event this is (e.g. whether we are in bold right now).</li>\\n</ul>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"return_value\",\"title\":\"Return value\",\"isH3\":true,\"content\":\"<p>None (<a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/undefined\\\"><code>undefined</code></a>).</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"notes\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>This enables or disables items (setting or clearing the \\\"disabled\\\" attribute on the command node as appropriate), or ensures that the command state reflects the state of the selection by setting current state information in the \\\"state\\\" attribute of the XUL command nodes.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"specifications\",\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>DOM Level 0. Not part of specification.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.updateCommands\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Notes\",\"id\":\"notes\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"}],\"summary\":\"Updates the state of commands of the current chrome window (UI).\",\"popularity\":0.0005,\"modified\":\"2023-12-30T14:46:02.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window.updateCommands()\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window.updateCommands()\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/updatecommands\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/updatecommands/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/eb289996538d1242cd7eaa54cbd9e20da0cb908c\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"updateCommands()\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/updateCommands\",\"title\":\"updateCommands()\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: updateCommands() method - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Instance methods", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage", "link_title": "webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage()", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage() method - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage() method\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage\" hreflang=\"en\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" href=\"/static/media/Inter.var.c2fe3cb2b7c746f7966a.woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"MDN Blog RSS Feed\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/blog/rss.xml\" hreflang=\"en\" /><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Given a WebKitPoint specified in a particular DOM Node&apos;s coordinate system, the Window method webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage() returns a Point which specifies the same position in the page&apos;s coordinate system. This method