\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The <strong><code>copy</code></strong> event fires when the user initiates a copy action through the browser's user interface.</p>\\n<p>The original target for this event is the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element\\\"><code>Element</code></a> that was the intended target of the copy action. You can listen for this event on the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> interface to handle it in the capture or bubbling phases. For full details on this event please see the page on the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/copy_event\\\">Element: copy event</a>.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>Use the event name in methods like <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener\\\" title=\\\"addEventListener()\\\"><code>addEventListener()</code></a>, or set an event handler property.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"P4mISDEb3fAtJ2bOOFxVDJZqgYbBCWFXBCBpUnCI2LI=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">addEventListener</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"copy\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token function-variable function\\\">oncopy</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"event_type\",\"title\":\"Event type\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>A <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/ClipboardEvent\\\"><code>ClipboardEvent</code></a>. Inherits from <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event\\\"><code>Event</code></a>.</p><svg viewBox=\\\"-1 -1 650 42\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMinYMin meet\\\">\\n  <a style=\\\"text-decoration: none;\\\" xlink:href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event\\\">\\n    <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" stroke=\\\"#D4DDE4\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2px\\\"></rect>\\n    <text x=\\\"37.5\\\" y=\\\"16\\\" font-size=\\\"10px\\\" fill=\\\"#4D4E53\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\">\\n      Event\\n    </text>\\n  </a>\\n  <line x1=\\\"75\\\" y1=\\\"14\\\" x2=\\\"105\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\" stroke=\\\"#D4DDE4\\\"></line>\\n  <polyline points=\\\"75,14 85,9 85,19 75,14\\\" stroke=\\\"#D4DDE4\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\"></polyline>\\n  <a style=\\\"text-decoration: none;\\\" xlink:href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/ClipboardEvent\\\">\\n    <rect x=\\\"105\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"112\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" fill=\\\"#F4F7F8\\\" stroke=\\\"#D4DDE4\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2px\\\"></rect>\\n    <text x=\\\"161\\\" y=\\\"16\\\" font-size=\\\"10px\\\" fill=\\\"#4D4E53\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\">\\n      ClipboardEvent\\n    </text>\\n  </a></svg>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"Ac/0j2zIX5BeJZhXX26Q8GPPKIGkPi0EWSIWe4HXVF0=\\\"><code>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">addEventListener</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"copy\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">log</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"copy action initiated\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://w3c.github.io/clipboard-apis/#clipboard-event-copy\",\"title\":\"Clipboard API and events\"},{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#handler-oncopy\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Element.copy_event\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Element.copy_event\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li>Related events: <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/cut_event\\\" title=\\\"cut\\\"><code>cut</code></a>, <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\" title=\\\"paste\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li>\\n  <li>This event on <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element\\\"><code>Element</code></a> targets: <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/copy_event\\\" title=\\\"copy\\\"><code>copy</code></a></li>\\n  <li>This event on <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document\\\"><code>Document</code></a> targets: <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/copy_event\\\" title=\\\"copy\\\"><code>copy</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Event type\",\"id\":\"event_type\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The copy event fires when the user initiates a copy action through the browser's user interface.\",\"popularity\":0.0011,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window: copy event\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window: copy \u00e3\u0082\u00a4\u00e3\u0083\u0099\u00e3\u0083\u00b3\u00e3\u0083\u0088\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window: copy \u00ec\u009d\u00b4\u00eb\u00b2\u00a4\u00ed\u008a\u00b8\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009acopy \u00e4\u00ba\u008b\u00e4\u00bb\u00b6\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/copy_event\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/copy_event/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"copy\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/