ow: devicemotion event - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: devicemotion event\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\" hreflang=\"fr\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: devicemotion \u00e3\u0082\u00a4\u00e3\u0083\u0099\u00e3\u0083\u00b3\u00e3\u0083\u0088\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\" hreflang=\"ja\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009adevicemotion \u00e4\u00ba\u008b\u00e4\u00bb\u00b6\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\" hreflang=\"zh\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: devicemotion event\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\" hreflang=\"en\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" href=\"/static/media/Inter.var.c2fe3cb2b7c746f7966a.woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"MDN Blog RSS Feed\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/blog/rss.xml\" hreflang=\"en\" /><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The devicemotion event is fired at a regular interval and indicates the acceleration rate of the device with/without the contribution of the gravity force at that time. It also provides information about the rate of rotation, if available.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Window: devicemotion event - Web APIs | MDN\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The devicemotion event is fired at a regular interval and indicates the acceleration rate of the device with/without the contribution of the gravity force at that time. It also provides information about the rate of rotation, if available.\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://develo