"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The <code>gamepaddisconnected</code> event is fired when the browser detects that a gamepad has been disconnected.</p>\\n<p>The event will not fire if disallowed by the document's <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Permissions-Policy/gamepad\\\"><code>gamepad</code></a> <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Permissions_Policy\\\">Permissions Policy</a>.</p>\\n<p>This event is not cancelable and does not bubble.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>To be informed when a gamepad is disconnected, you can add a handler to the window using <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener\\\" title=\\\"addEventListener()\\\"><code>addEventListener()</code></a>, like this:</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"sykapOKB+EQPgTtsRhC/cSZVULYLyAuoNhQb2KxT/E0=\\\"><code>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">addEventListener</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"gamepaddisconnected\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">log</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"Lost connection with the gamepad.\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\\n<p>Alternatively, you can use the <code>window.ongamepaddisconnected</code> event handler property to establish a handler for the <code>gamepaddisconnected</code> event:</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"PyRgpas22SuxI3BGeZZeMvaRbZmDL0RzYQJsic8Vos4=\\\"><code>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function-variable function\\\">ongamepaddisconnected</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">log</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"Lost connection with the gamepad.\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://w3c.github.io/gamepad/#event-gamepaddisconnected\",\"title\":\"Gamepad\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.gamepaddisconnected_event\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.gamepaddisconnected_event\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepadconnected_event\\\">gamepadconnected</a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Gamepad_API/Using_the_Gamepad_API\\\">Using Gamepad API</a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The gamepaddisconnected event is fired when the browser detects that a gamepad has been disconnected.\",\"popularity\":0,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"gamepaddisconnected\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window: gamepaddisconnected \u00e3\u0082\u00a4\u00e3\u0083\u0099\u00e3\u0083\u00b3\u00e3\u0083\u0088\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ru\",\"title\":\"gamepaddisconnected\",\"native\":\"\u00d0\u00a0\u00d1\u0083\u00d1\u0081\u00d1\u0081\u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00b8\u00d0\u00b9\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/gamepaddisconnected_event\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/gamepaddisconnected_event/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"gamepaddisconnected\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepaddisconnected_event\",\"title\":\"gamepaddisconnected\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: gamepaddisconnected event - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Events", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/hashchange_event", "link_title": "hashchange", "html": "<!doctype html><htm