/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientation_event\\\"><code>deviceorientation</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientationabsolute_event\\\"><code>deviceorientationabsolute</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/error_event\\\"><code>error</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/focus_event\\\"><code>focus</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepadconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepadconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepaddisconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepaddisconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/hashchange_event\\\"><code>hashchange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/languagechange_event\\\"><code>languagechange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><em><code>messageerror</code> </em></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_ev