on-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Events</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/afterprint_event\\\"><code>afterprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/appinstalled_event\\\"><code>appinstalled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeinstallprompt_event\\\"><code>beforeinstallprompt</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeprint_event\\\"><code>beforeprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeunload_event\\\"><code>beforeunload</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/blur_event\\\"><code>blur</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/copy_event\\\"><code>copy</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/cut_event\\\"><code>cut</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\\\"><code>devicemotion</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientation_event\\\"><code>deviceorientation</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientationabsolute_event\\\"><code>deviceorientationabsolute</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/error_event\\\"><code>error</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/focus_event\\\"><code>focus</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepadconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepadconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepaddisconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepaddisconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/hashchange_event\\\"><code>hashchange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/languagechange_event\\\"><code>languagechange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><em><code>online</code> </em></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The <strong><code>online</code></strong> event of the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> interface is fired when the browser has gained access to the network and the value of <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/onLine\\\"><code>Navigator.onLine</code></a> switches to <code>true</code>.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"notecard note\\\" id=\\\"sect1\\\">\\n  <p><strong>Note:</strong> This event shouldn't be used to determine the availability of a particular website. Network problems or firewalls might still prevent the website from being reached.</p>\\n</div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>Use the event name in methods like <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener\\\" title=\\\"addEventListener()\\\"><code>addEventListener()</code></a>, or set an event handler property.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"G4dMuT6rzKz7CNqhP2tURkM+0u38tb0eJpvfsoI9tM0=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">addEventListener</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"online\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token function-variable function\\\">ononline</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"event_type\",\"title\":\"Event type\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>A generic <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event\\\"><code>Event</code></a>.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"event_handler_aliases\",\"title\":\"Event handler aliases\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>In addition to the <code>Window</code> interface, the event handler property <code>ononline</code> is also available on the following targets:</p>\\n<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLBodyElement\\\"><code>HTMLBodyElement</code></a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLFrameSetElement\\\"><code>HTMLFrameSetElement</code></a></li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/SVGSVGElement\\\"><code>SVGSVGElement</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"F9c6RxbfCcE0dvG7VVA1B73sLvNGYuJuj8K1T6i+LQ4=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// addEventListener version</span>\\nwindow<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">addEventListener</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"online\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">log</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"You are now connected to the network.\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token comment\\\">// ononline version</span>\\nwindow<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function-variable function\\\">ononline</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">log</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"You are now connected to the network.\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#event-online\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"},{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#handler-window-ononline\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Window.online_event\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Window.online_event\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Event type\",\"id\":\"event_type\"},{\"text\":\"Event handler aliases\",\"id\":\"event_handler_aliases\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The online event of the Window interface is fired when the browser has gained access to the network and the value of Navigator.onLine switches to true.\",\"popularity\":0.007,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"es\",\"title\":\"Window: Evento online\",\"native\":\"Espa\u00c3\u00b1ol\"},{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window: online event\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window: online \u00e3\u0082\u00a4\u00e3\u0083\u0099\u00e3\u0083\u00b3\u00e3\u0083\u0088\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009aonline \u00e4\u00ba\u008b\u00e4\u00bb\u00b6\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/online_event\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/online_event/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"online\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{