dard</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage\\\"><code>webkitConvertPointFromNodeToPage()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/webkitConvertPointFromPageToNode\\\"><code>webkitConvertPointFromPageToNode()</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Events</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/afterprint_event\\\"><code>afterprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/appinstalled_event\\\"><code>appinstalled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeinstallprompt_event\\\"><code>beforeinstallprompt</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeprint_event\\\"><code>beforeprint</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/beforeunload_event\\\"><code>beforeunload</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/blur_event\\\"><code>blur</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/copy_event\\\"><code>copy</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/cut_event\\\"><code>cut</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/devicemotion_event\\\"><code>devicemotion</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientation_event\\\"><code>deviceorientation</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/deviceorientationabsolute_event\\\"><code>deviceorientationabsolute</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/error_event\\\"><code>error</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/focus_event\\\"><code>focus</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepadconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepadconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/gamepaddisconnected_event\\\"><code>gamepaddisconnected</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/hashchange_event\\\"><code>hashchange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/languagechange_event\\\"><code>languagechange</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/load_event\\\"><code>load</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/message_event\\\"><code>message</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/messageerror_event\\\"><code>messageerror</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/offline_event\\\"><code>offline</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/online_event\\\"><code>online</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/orientationchange_event\\\"><code>orientationchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pagehide_event\\\"><code>pagehide</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/pageshow_event\\\"><code>pageshow</code></a></li><li><em><code>paste</code> </em></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\\\"><code>popstate</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/rejectionhandled_event\\\"><code>rejectionhandled</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/resize_event\\\"><code>resize</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/storage_event\\\"><code>storage</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unhandledrejection_event\\\"><code>unhandledrejection</code></a></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\\\"><code>unload</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplayconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplayconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydeactivate_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydeactivate</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaydisconnect_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaydisconnect</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/vrdisplaypresentchange_event\\\"><code>vrdisplaypresentchange</code></a><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-nonstandard\\\" title=\\\"Non-standard. Check cross-browser support before using.\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Non-standard</span>\\n</abbr><abbr class=\\\"icon icon-deprecated\\\" title=\\\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\">Deprecated</span>\\n</abbr></li></ol></details></li><li class=\\\"toggle\\\"><details open=\\\"\\\"><summary>Inheritance</summary><ol><li><a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget\\\"><code>EventTarget</code></a></li></ol></details></li></ol>\",\"sidebarMacro\":\"APIRef\",\"body\":[{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":null,\"title\":null,\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>The <strong><code>paste</code></strong> event is fired when the user has initiated a \\\"paste\\\" action through the browser's user interface.</p>\\n<p>The original target for this event is the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element\\\"><code>Element</code></a> that was the intended target of the paste action. You can listen for this event on the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\\\"><code>Window</code></a> interface to handle it in the capture or bubbling phases. For full details on this event please see the page on the <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/paste_event\\\">Element: paste event</a>.</p>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"syntax\",\"title\":\"Syntax\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>Use the event name in methods like <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener\\\" title=\\\"addEventListener()\\\"><code>addEventListener()</code></a>, or set an event handler property.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"c8eYqxaB5+34ZdjFwaUeN3Ms4cBctJs4lthJHVrX78s=\\\"><code><span class=\\\"token function\\\">addEventListener</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"paste\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"token function-variable function\\\">onpaste</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"event_type\",\"title\":\"Event type\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<p>A <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/ClipboardEvent\\\"><code>ClipboardEvent</code></a>. Inherits from <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event\\\"><code>Event</code></a>.</p><svg viewBox=\\\"-1 -1 650 42\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMinYMin meet\\\">\\n  <a style=\\\"text-decoration: none;\\\" xlink:href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event\\\">\\n    <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" stroke=\\\"#D4DDE4\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2px\\\"></rect>\\n    <text x=\\\"37.5\\\" y=\\\"16\\\" font-size=\\\"10px\\\" fill=\\\"#4D4E53\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\">\\n      Event\\n    </text>\\n  </a>\\n  <line x1=\\\"75\\\" y1=\\\"14\\\" x2=\\\"105\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\" stroke=\\\"#D4DDE4\\\"></line>\\n  <polyline points=\\\"75,14 85,9 85,19 75,14\\\" stroke=\\\"#D4DDE4\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\"></polyline>\\n  <a style=\\\"text-decoration: none;\\\" xlink:href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/ClipboardEvent\\\">\\n    <rect x=\\\"105\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"112\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" fill=\\\"#F4F7F8\\\" stroke=\\\"#D4DDE4\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2px\\\"></rect>\\n    <text x=\\\"161\\\" y=\\\"16\\\" font-size=\\\"10px\\\" fill=\\\"#4D4E53\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\">\\n      ClipboardEvent\\n    </text>\\n  </a></svg>\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"examples\",\"title\":\"Examples\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"code-example\\\"><div class=\\\"example-header\\\"><span class=\\\"language-name\\\">js</span></div><pre class=\\\"brush: js notranslate\\\" data-signature=\\\"MPPV7XQtvsIa/6POFKeWybySiT3sAHrk/mh31q6lEbY=\\\"><code>window<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">addEventListener</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"paste\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">,</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token parameter\\\">event</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span> <span class=\\\"token operator\\\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">.</span><span class=\\\"token function\\\">log</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"token string\\\">\\\"paste action initiated\\\"</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">}</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">)</span><span class=\\\"token punctuation\\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre></div>\"}},{\"type\":\"specifications\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\",\"isH3\":false,\"specifications\":[{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://w3c.github.io/clipboard-apis/#clipboard-event-paste\",\"title\":\"Clipboard API and events\"},{\"bcdSpecificationURL\":\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#handler-onpaste\",\"title\":\"HTML Standard\"}],\"query\":\"api.Element.paste_event\"}},{\"type\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"value\":{\"title\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\",\"isH3\":false,\"query\":\"api.Element.paste_event\"}},{\"type\":\"prose\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"see_also\",\"title\":\"See also\",\"isH3\":false,\"content\":\"<ul>\\n  <li>Related events: <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/cut_event\\\" title=\\\"cut\\\"><code>cut</code></a>, <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/copy_event\\\" title=\\\"copy\\\"><code>copy</code></a></li>\\n  <li>This event on <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element\\\"><code>Element</code></a> targets: <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/paste_event\\\" title=\\\"paste\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li>\\n  <li>This event on <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document\\\"><code>Document</code></a> targets: <a href=\\\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/paste_event\\\" title=\\\"paste\\\"><code>paste</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\"}}],\"toc\":[{\"text\":\"Syntax\",\"id\":\"syntax\"},{\"text\":\"Event type\",\"id\":\"event_type\"},{\"text\":\"Examples\",\"id\":\"examples\"},{\"text\":\"Specifications\",\"id\":\"specifications\"},{\"text\":\"Browser compatibility\",\"id\":\"browser_compatibility\"},{\"text\":\"See also\",\"id\":\"see_also\"}],\"summary\":\"The paste event is fired when the user has initiated a \\\"paste\\\" action through the browser's user interface.\",\"popularity\":0.001,\"modified\":\"2023-04-08T06:57:07.000Z\",\"other_translations\":[{\"locale\":\"fr\",\"title\":\"Window: paste event\",\"native\":\"Fran\u00c3\u00a7ais\"},{\"locale\":\"ja\",\"title\":\"Window: paste \u00e3\u0082\u00a4\u00e3\u0083\u0099\u00e3\u0083\u00b3\u00e3\u0083\u0088\",\"native\":\"\u00e6\u0097\u00a5\u00e6\u009c\u00ac\u00e8\u00aa\u009e\"},{\"locale\":\"ko\",\"title\":\"Window: paste \u00ec\u009d\u00b4\u00eb\u00b2\u00a4\u00ed\u008a\u00b8\",\"native\":\"\u00ed\u0095\u009c\u00ea\u00b5\u00ad\u00ec\u0096\u00b4\"},{\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"title\":\"Window\u00ef\u00bc\u009apaste \u00e4\u00ba\u008b\u00e4\u00bb\u00b6\",\"native\":\"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e6\u0096\u0087 (\u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e4\u00bd\u0093)\"}],\"source\":{\"folder\":\"en-us/web/api/window/paste_event\",\"github_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/window/paste_event/index.md\",\"last_commit_url\":\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/cc070123f72376faec06e36622c4fc723a75325f\",\"filename\":\"index.md\"},\"short_title\":\"paste\",\"parents\":[{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web\",\"title\":\"References\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API\",\"title\":\"Web APIs\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window\",\"title\":\"Window\"},{\"uri\":\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/paste_event\",\"title\":\"paste\"}],\"pageTitle\":\"Window: paste event - Web APIs | MDN\",\"noIndexing\":false}}</script></body></html>"}, {"section_name": "Events", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event", "link_title": "popstate", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en-US\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-48x48.cbbd161b.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.6803c6f0.png\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.56b1cedc.json\"/><link rel=\"search\" type=\"application/opensearchdescription+xml\" href=\"/opensearch.xml\" title=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><title>Window: popstate event - Web APIs | MDN</title><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"onpopstate\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/es/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"es\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"popstate\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"fr\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: popstate \u00e3\u0082\u00a4\u00e3\u0083\u0099\u00e3\u0083\u00b3\u00e3\u0083\u0088\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"ja\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"popstate\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"ko\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"popstate\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/pt-BR/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"pt\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"popstate\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ru/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"ru\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"WindowEventHandlers.onpopstate\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"zh\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"window.onpopstate\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-TW/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"zh-Hant\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"Window: popstate event\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\" hreflang=\"en\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" href=\"/static/media/Inter.var.c2fe3cb2b7c746f7966a.woff2\" crossorigin><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"MDN Blog RSS Feed\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/blog/rss.xml\" hreflang=\"en\" /><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The popstate event of the Window interface is fired when the active history entry changes while the user navigates the session history. It changes the current history entry to that of the last page the user visited or, if history.pushState() has been used to add a history entry to the history stack, that history entry is used instead.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Window: popstate event - Web APIs | MDN\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The popstate event of the Window interface is fired when the active history entry changes while the user navigates the session history. It changes the current history entry to that of the last page the user visited or, if history.pushState() has been used to add a history entry to the history stack, that history entry is used instead.\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/mdn-social-share.cd6c4a5a.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1080\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1920\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"The MDN Web Docs logo, featuring a blue accent color, displayed on a solid black background.\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"MDN Web Docs\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"MozDevNet\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/popstate_event\"/><style media=\"print\">.article-actions-container,.document-toc-container,.language-menu,.main-menu-toggle,.on-github,.page-footer,.place,.sidebar,.top-banner,.top-navigation-main,ul.prev-next{display:none!important}.main-page-content,.main-page-content pre{padding:2px}.main-page-content pre{border-left-width:2px}</style><script src=\"/static/js/gtag.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script defer=\"defer\" src=\"/static/js/main.0bde0159.js\"></script><link href=\"/static/css/main.5208d977.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"></head><body><script>if(document.body.addEventListener(\"load\",(t=>{t.target.classList.contains(\"interactive\")&&t.target.setAttribute(\"data-readystate\",\"complete\")